Third-party component: Mbed TLS
-------------------------------

The plugin's library contains parts of Mbed TLS 3.6.7 (its AES, GCM,
ChaCha20-Poly1305, SHA-1/SHA-2, HMAC and HKDF code), which the build
fetches from its release (CMakeLists.txt) and links in statically, for the
TLS decryption.  Mbed TLS is dual-licensed under the Apache License 2.0 or
the GNU General Public License version 2 or later; this plugin takes it
under the GPL-2.0-or-later, which combines with its own GPL-3.0-or-later.
The sources and the full license texts are those of the release:
https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/tag/mbedtls-3.6.7

